			modulesInBuilding [ inventory-basement-small flavor-drugs [ bootlegger-homebooze-a bootlegger-homebooze-b bootlegger-homebooze-c bootlegger-homebooze-d ]	]

			playerTakeoverCost { value  1000 mods [
